---
title: "redeem (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: assert_current_version(version)
    q_version --> q_whitelist: assert_whitelist_access(market, ctx)
    q_whitelist --> q_calc_time: now = clock_timestamp_ms / 1000
    q_calc_time --> q_handle_redeem: market_coin_amount = coin_value(coin)
    q_handle_redeem --> q_emit: redeem_balance = market::handle_redeem(market, balance, now)
    q_emit --> [*]: return coin::from_balance(redeem_balance, ctx)

    note right of q_handle_redeem
        INV-001: redeem_balance reflects accrued interest at exchange rate at time now
        INV-002: sCoin is burned and underlying asset returned proportionally
        INV-003: market cash decreases by exactly redeem_balance amount
    end note
